1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Today: Bayes' theorem. P of A given B equals P of B given A times P of A, over P of B.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Example. A test for a disease. The disease affects one percent of people.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:27,000
The test catches ninety-nine percent of sick people, and has a five percent false positive rate.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:36,000
You test positive. Most of you think you're ninety-nine percent sick. Work it out at home, we'll see next week.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:41,000
That's it for today.
